{
  "name": "ListUsersByVDC",
  "summary": "查询指定VDC的用户列表(已废弃)",
  "tags": "VDC",
  "productshort": "ManageOneSCHCS",
  "region_id": "ap-southeast-3",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/vdc/v3.0/vdcs/{vdc_id}/users": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询指定VDC的用户列表(已废弃)",
        "x-resource": "租户管理",
        "description": "查询指定VDC下用户列表。\n由于该接口支持根据email精确搜索用户,存在安全风险。\n8.5.0版本后,该接口默认会返回北向账号(user_type=4)。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -i -H \"Accept: application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X GET \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/vdcs/13f43194-2f54-472f-b03f-aacbd98f9cb4/users\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|180次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|30次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "ListUsersByVDC",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,机机账号权限,VDC管理员权限,vdc业务员权限,vdc只读权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "vdc_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "VDC ID,以本VDC ID为根节点,只能包含小写字母、数字、中划线,长度在1-36之间。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "query_string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "按照角色名称或用户名称或VDC名称查询。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "role_tag",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "IAM角色名列表,默认查询所有可见范围内的角色。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "roles",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "角色ID列表,默认查询所有可见范围内的角色。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "level",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "VDC级别列表,默认查询所有可见范围内的VDC级别,与VDC角色配合使用。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "has_phone",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "电话过滤字段,值为true,false或者为空。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "has_email",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "邮箱过滤字段,值为true,false或者为空。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "已经废弃。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_key",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "排序字段。枚举值:name,create_at。默认值为name。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "排序方向。枚举值:desc和asc。默认值:asc。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "按照名称或显示名字段模糊搜索。长度:1到128个字符。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "enabled",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "使用enabled字段精确搜索。枚举值:true和false。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "email",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "邮箱字段支持精确搜索。长度:1到64个字符。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "分页查询的起始位置,默认从0开始,取值在0-2147483647之间。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "限制每页显示的条目数量,取值范围1-100。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "user_type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "按照用户认证类型查询。本地认证类型值为0,SAML认证类型值为1,LDAP认证类型值为2,机机用户值为4,CAS认证类型值为5,OAuth认证类型值为6。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "inherit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "是否全量查询用户。",
            "type": "string",
            "default": "true"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询VDC下用户列表成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/UserListDetails"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "total": 1,
                "users": [
                  {
                    "enabled": "true",
